ad."}},{"q":{"fr":"Combien de couleurs ont les pierres de Nüwa ?","en":"How many colours do Nüwa's stones have?"},"options":[{"fr":"Trois","en":"Three"},{"fr":"Cinq","en":"Five"},{"fr":"Sept","en":"Seven"},{"fr":"Neuf","en":"Nine"}],"answer":1,"why":{"fr":"« wǔ zhǒng yánsè de shítou » : rouge, jaune, bleu, blanc, noir.","en":"“wǔ zhǒng yánsè de shítou”: red, yellow, blue, white, black."}},{"q":{"fr":"Que sont devenues les pierres de couleur, selon la légende ?","en":"According to the legend, what did the coloured stones become?"},"options":[{"fr":"Les étoiles","en":"The stars"},{"fr":"Les nuages colorés du ciel","en":"The coloured clouds in the sky"},{"fr":"L'arc-en-ciel de la pluie","en":"Rainbows after rain"},{"fr":"Les montagnes","en":"The mountains"}],"answer":1,"why":{"fr":"Les cǎixiá (nuages colorés) auraient la couleur des cinq pierres.","en":"The cǎixiá (coloured clouds) are said to have the colours of the five stones."}},{"q":{"fr":"Avec quoi Nüwa fait-elle les quatre nouveaux piliers ?","en":"What does Nüwa use for the four new pillars?"},"options":[{"fr":"Quatre arbres","en":"Four trees"},{"fr":"Les pattes d'une tortue géante","en":"The legs of a giant turtle"},{"fr":"Des pierres de couleur","en":"Coloured stones"},{"fr":"Quatre montagnes","en":"Four mountains"}],"answer":1,"why":{"fr":"« yòng tā de sì tiáo tuǐ zuò le sì gēn xīn de zhùzi ».","en":"“yòng tā de sì tiáo tuǐ zuò le sì gēn xīn de zhùzi”."}},{"q":{"fr":"Où Nüwa s'assoit-elle quand elle se sent seule ?","en":"Where does Nüwa sit when she feels lonely?"},"options":[{"fr":"Au bord de la rivière","en":"By the river"},{"fr":"Sur une montagne","en":"On a mountain"},{"fr":"Sous un arbre","en":"Under a tree"},{"fr":"Dans une grotte","en":"In a cave"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« Tā zuò zài hé biān, kànzhe shuǐ lǐ de zìjǐ. »","en":"“Tā zuò zài hé biān, kànzhe shuǐ lǐ de zìjǐ.”"}},{"q":{"fr":"Comment le petit homme prend-il vie ?","en":"How does the little person come alive?"},"options":[{"fr":"Nüwa souffle sur lui","en":"Nüwa blows on him"},{"fr":"Il boit de l'eau","en":"He drinks water"},{"fr":"Le soleil le chauffe","en":"The sun warms him"},{"fr":"Nüwa chante","en":"Nüwa sings"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« duì xiǎo rén chuī le yì kǒu qì. »","en":"“duì xiǎo rén chuī le yì kǒu qì.”"}},{"q":{"fr":"Qu'enseigne Nüwa aux humains ?","en":"What does Nüwa teach the people?"},"options":[{"fr":"À se marier et vivre en famille","en":"To marry and live as families"},{"fr":"À écrire","en":"To write"},{"fr":"À faire la guerre","en":"To fight"},{"fr":"À voler","en":"To fly"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« jiào tāmen jiéhūn, shēng háizi, yì jiā rén yìqǐ shēnghuó. »","en":"“jiào tāmen jiéhūn, shēng háizi, yì jiā rén yìqǐ shēnghuó.”"}},{"q":{"fr":"Qui se battent dans le ciel ?","en":"Who fight in the sky?"},"options":[{"fr":"Le dieu de l'eau et le dieu du feu","en":"The god of water and the god of fire"},{"fr":"Pangu et Nüwa","en":"Pangu and Nüwa"},{"fr":"Deux dragons","en":"Two dragons"},{"fr":"Le soleil et la lune","en":"The sun and the moon"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"Gònggōng (shuǐ shén) et Zhùróng (huǒ shén).","en":"Gònggōng (shuǐ shén) and Zhùróng (huǒ shén)."}},{"q":{"fr":"Combien de temps Nüwa fait-elle brûler les pierres ?","en":"How long does Nüwa burn the stones?"},"options":[{"fr":"Neuf jours et neuf nuits","en":"Nine days and nine nights"},{"fr":"Un jour","en":"One day"},{"fr":"Un an","en":"One year"},{"fr":"Trois heures","en":"Three hours"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« shāo le jiǔ tiān jiǔ yè ».","en":"“shāo le jiǔ tiān jiǔ yè”."}},{"q":{"fr":"Avec quoi arrête-t-elle les grandes eaux ?","en":"What does she use to stop the floods?"},"options":[{"fr":"Avec la cendre de roseaux brûlés","en":"Ashes of burnt reeds"},{"fr":"Avec des pierres","en":"Stones"},{"fr":"Avec un mur","en":"A wall"},{"fr":"Avec la tortue","en":"The turtle"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« yòng lúwěi shāo chéng de huī dǎngzhù le dà shuǐ ».","en":"“yòng lúwěi shāo chéng de huī dǎngzhù le dà shuǐ”."}}],"chars":702}